smiling and handing a blue receipt to the customer to confirm that their parcels have been accepted.","panama.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJCZbqstJ9-Tfj_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2610.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJCZbqstJ9-Tfj",{"x":84,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},38,"none","Choose reliable shipping to Panama",[88,93],{"type":89,"text":90,"spans":91,"direction":92},"paragraph","It’s fitting that the home of the Panama Canal, a pillar of global trade, has access to such fast and reliable shipping from the UK. To send a parcel to Panama, all you need to do is book online and head down to your local ParcelShop or Locker to drop off. And you can do all of this today! Get your parcel on the move without delay.  ",[],"ltr",{"type":89,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":92},"Our South American parcel network is constantly growing, with courier services to Argentina, Costa Rica delivery and more available to all our UK customers. Send a parcel internationally today with Evri.",[96,110,112,118],{"start":97,"end":98,"type":99,"data":100},62,91,"hyperlink",{"id":101,"type":102,"tags":103,"lang":15,"slug":105,"first_publication_date":106,"last_publication_date":107,"uid":108,"url":109,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"aFwL8BAAACAA-EhM","content-page",[104],"International","send-to-argentina-in-one-of-three-easy-ways","2025-06-25T15:02:08+0000","2026-05-06T05:02:06+0000","argentina","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fargentina",{"start":97,"end":98,"type":111},"strong",{"start":113,"end":114,"type":99,"data":115},93,112,{"link_type":36,"url":116,"target":117},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fcosta-rica","_blank",{"start":113,"end":114,"type":111},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":122,"version":31,"items":123,"primary":144,"id":168,"slice_type":169,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[124,128,131,134,139],{"column_1_cell":125,"column_2_cell":126,"column_3_cell":127,"column_4_cell":127},"250g","£22.09","-",{"column_1_cell":129,"column_2_cell":130,"column_3_cell":127,"column_4_cell":127},"500g","£23.29",{"column_1_cell":132,"column_2_cell":133,"column_3_cell":127,"column_4_cell":127},"1kg","£25.59",{"column_1_cell":135,"column_2_cell":136,"column_3_cell":137,"column_4_cell":138},"2kg","£30.09","£28.37","£1.72",{"column_1_cell":140,"column_2_cell":141,"column_3_cell":142,"column_4_cell":143},"5kg","£47.99","£45.25","£2.74",{"PricingTableImage":145,"PricingTableHeader":148,"PricingTableText":149,"PricingTableButtonText":156,"PricingTableButtonUrl":157,"scrollDown":20,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":46,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":160,"buttonGtmTrack":46,"PricingTableDescription":162,"table_header_row_blue":163,"table_rightmost_column_blue":163,"column_name_1":164,"column_name_2":165,"column_name_3":166,"column_name_4":167},{"dimensions":146,"alt":62,"copyright":46,"url":63,"id":64,"edit":147},{"width":60,"height":61},{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"How much does it cost to send a parcel to Panama?",[150],{"type":89,"text":151,"spans":152,"direction":92},"Sending a parcel to Panama is cheaper than you might think with Evri. We deliver packages up to 15kg all over the world, fully tracked and with £20 parcel cover included for no extra cost. If you use code SAVEON£30 at checkout, you can even get a discount on orders over £30.  ",[153],{"start":154,"end":155,"type":111},205,215,"Send a parcel to Panama",{"link_type":36,"key":158,"url":159},"96a7e95e-c5af-4939-98e3-717e165e53ea","panama.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send",{"link_type":161},"Any","Prices quoted are ‘starting from’ and may change based on the volumetric weight of a parcel. SAVEON£30 discount applies only on orders over £30; discounted prices above are per parcel.",true,"Parcel weight","Prices from","With SAVEON£30","Savings","pricing_table_v2$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":122,"version":31,"items":171,"primary":172,"id":174,"slice_type":175,"slice_label":46},[],{"SectionHeader":46,"SectionText":173},[],"section_component$f22dcf7c-48a0-4c38-a71b-4f2541489947","section_component",{"variation":177,"version":31,"items":178,"primary":180,"id":256,"slice_type":120,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[179],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":181,"CardText":182,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":255,"IsEco":20},"Public holidays in Panama that could affect shipping times",[183,186,192,197,202,207,212,217,222,227,232,237,242,246,250],{"type":89,"text":184,"spans":185,"direction":92},"A public holiday in Panama could cause a potential delay in your parcel's delivery time, so it’s important to be aware of them. We would always recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time. ",[],{"type":187,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":92},"list-item","New Year's Day - 01\u002F01\u002F2026 ",[190],{"start":66,"end":191,"type":111},14,{"type":187,"text":193,"spans":194,"direction":92},"Martyrs' Day - 09\u002F01\u002F2026",[195],{"start":66,"end":196,"type":111},12,{"type":187,"text":198,"spans":199,"direction":92},"Carnival - 17\u002F02\u002F2026",[200],{"start":66,"end":201,"type":111},8,{"type":187,"text":203,"spans":204,"direction":92},"Maundy Thursday - 02\u002F04\u002F2026",[205],{"start":66,"end":206,"type":111},16,{"type":187,"text":208,"spans":209,"direction":92},"Good Friday - 03\u002F04\u002F2026",[210],{"start":66,"end":211,"type":111},11,{"type":187,"text":213,"spans":214,"direction":92},"Labour Day - 01\u002F05\u002F2026",[215],{"start":66,"end":216,"type":111},10,{"type":187,"text":218,"spans":219,"direction":92},"Independence Day from Colombia - 03\u002F11\u002F2026",[220],{"start":66,"end":221,"type":111},30,{"type":187,"text":223,"spans":224,"direction":92},"National Symbols Day - 04\u002F11\u002F2026",[225],{"start":66,"end":226,"type":111},21,{"type":187,"text":228,"spans":229,"direction":92},"Colón Day - 05\u002F11\u002F2026",[230],{"start":66,"end":231,"type":111},9,{"type":187,"text":233,"spans":234,"direction":92},"Uprising of Los Santos - 10\u002F11\u002F2026",[235],{"start":66,"end":236,"type":111},22,{"type":187,"text":238,"spans":239,"direction":92},"Independence Day from Spain - 28\u002F11\u002F2026",[240],{"start":66,"end":241,"type":111},27,{"type":187,"text":243,"spans":244,"direction":92},"Mother's Day - 08\u002F12\u002F2026",[245],{"start":66,"end":196,"type":111},{"type":187,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":92},"National Mourning Day - 20\u002F12\u002F2026",[249],{"start":66,"end":226,"type":111},{"type":187,"text":251,"spans":252,"direction":92},"Christmas Day - 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[253],{"start":66,"end":254,"type":111},13,{"link_type":161},"card$49c696ff-412f-4067-bfb4-7291d135aa40",{"variation":258,"version":31,"items":259,"primary":320,"id":330,"slice_type":331,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[260,281,300],{"Title":261,"Description":266,"Image":270,"Label":46,"UrlText":276,"Url":277,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":280,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[262],{"type":263,"text":264,"spans":265},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[267],{"type":89,"text":268,"spans":269,"direction":92},"Drop off your parcel at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops located all over the country. Book your parcel online and print your label at home or in-store at your nearest ParcelShop using our free Print in ParcelShop devices. You can also book your delivery in person at selected Post Offices. ",[],{"dimensions":271,"alt":272,"copyright":46,"url":273,"id":274,"edit":275},{"width":78,"height":79},"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","panama.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":66,"y":201,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":36,"key":278,"url":279},"1cca406f-27ae-4d09-8f22-677c1b65d1d7","\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":161},{"Title":282,"Description":286,"Image":290,"Label":46,"UrlText":296,"Url":297,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":299,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[283],{"type":263,"text":284,"spans":285},"Lockers",[],[287],{"type":89,"text":288,"spans":289,"direction":92},"With conveniently located Lockers available to Evri customers, safe and secure parcel drop-off is right around the corner. Just locate your nearest Locker, scan the barcode, and pop your parcel inside, ready to be collected.  ",[],{"dimensions":291,"alt":292,"copyright":46,"url":293,"id":294,"edit":295},{"width":78,"height":79},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","panama.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":66,"y":201,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Locate your nearest Locker",{"link_type":36,"key":298,"url":279},"f1e23d2a-766b-443a-95a6-62e084df1b68",{"link_type":161},{"Title":301,"Description":305,"Image":309,"Label":46,"UrlText":315,"Url":316,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":319,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[302],{"type":263,"text":303,"spans":304},"Couriers",[],[306],{"type":89,"text":307,"spans":308,"direction":92},"Don’t let a parcel drop-off disrupt your schedule. Book a courier collection to get your parcel on the move directly from your home or office. Simply choose a date that suits you, and we’ll provide a 1-hour window to come and collect.   ",[],{"dimensions":310,"alt":311,"copyright":46,"url":312,"id":313,"edit":314},{"width":78,"height":79},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is signing a blue slip. Blue Evri van visible in the background.","panama.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10213.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp",{"x":66,"y":201,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Book a courier collection today",{"link_type":36,"key":317,"url":318},"f980a8e2-e519-489e-acfb-954b3235624e","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":161},{"SectionTitle":321,"SectionDescription":326,"theme":46},[322],{"type":323,"text":324,"spans":325,"direction":92},"heading2","Send to Panama in one of three easy ways ",[],[327],{"type":89,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":92},"We send parcels at your convenience. With our ever-expanding network of ParcelShops and Lockers, we’re closer to your community than ever. Combine that with our courier collection service, and parcel drop-off will never be a hassle for Evri customers. Find out more about these services:   ",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":122,"version":31,"items":333,"primary":334,"id":348,"slice_type":120,"slice_label":46},[],{"CardImage":335,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":341,"CardText":342,"ButtonText":156,"ButtonUrl":346,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":336,"alt":337,"copyright":46,"url":338,"id":339,"edit":340},{"width":78,"height":79},"An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. They are laughing whilst using a laptop.","panama.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10821.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7",{"x":66,"y":201,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Customs made simple with Evri",[343],{"type":89,"text":344,"spans":345,"direction":92},"If you’re worried about customs forms and admin, don’t be! At Evri, we take care of all the paperwork for you by processing it all in the background using the information you provide when you make the booking. We even have a lookup function for HS codes, so just tell us what’s in the box and we’ll fill that part in for you. Sending a parcel internationally should be stress-free, so make it easy by sending with Evri today.  ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":347,"url":159},"b98f3e26-75c2-4f87-8f65-31d4469f6d02","card$c1d3910c-7ce1-4347-9ab5-34e40a08b7bb",{"variation":122,"version":31,"items":350,"primary":352,"id":393,"slice_type":120,"slice_label":46},[351],{},{"CardImage":353,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":360,"CardText":361,"ButtonText":390,"ButtonUrl":391,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":354,"alt":356,"copyright":46,"url":357,"id":358,"edit":359},{"width":78,"height":355},667,"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","panama.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Send multiple parcels to Panama with ease",[362,365,369,372,387],{"type":89,"text":363,"spans":364,"direction":92},"If you’re an online seller looking to send a few parcels to Panama in one go, then we’ve got the solution for you. Between our marketplace integrations and CSV upload capabilities, you can book as many parcels as you want in just a few short steps:  ",[],{"type":366,"text":367,"spans":368,"direction":92},"o-list-item","Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file ",[],{"type":366,"text":370,"spans":371,"direction":92},"Package up your items and book your parcels all at once ",[],{"type":366,"text":373,"spans":374,"direction":92},"Print off your postage labels at home or at a ParcelShop using a Print in ParcelShop device ",[375,386],{"start":376,"end":377,"type":99,"data":378},65,92,{"id":379,"type":102,"tags":380,"lang":15,"slug":381,"first_publication_date":382,"last_publication_date":383,"uid":384,"url":385,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"YhadqhIAACsA0rN4",[264],"print-in-parcelshop--print-parcel-labels--evri","2022-02-23T21:16:27+0000","2026-03-18T09:48:59+0000","print-in-parcelshop","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",{"start":376,"end":98,"type":111},{"type":366,"text":388,"spans":389,"direction":92},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ drop-off locations across the country or let your courier make a collection.",[],"Send multiple parcels to Panama",{"link_type":36,"key":392,"url":38},"e6974bb4-4ba1-4fc3-9fcf-26c634ea06e8","card$93d4bb75-307c-477d-b60c-f6458e923fd2",{"variation":395,"version":31,"items":396,"primary":477,"id":480,"slice_type":481,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[397,416,428,440,453,465],{"title":398,"content":399,"icon":409},"Regular tracking updates",[400],{"type":89,"text":401,"spans":402,"direction":92},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[403,408],{"start":404,"end":405,"type":99,"data":406},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":407,"target":117},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":404,"end":405,"type":111},{"dimensions":410,"alt":412,"copyright":46,"url":413,"id":414,"edit":415},{"width":411,"height":411},40,"Phone icon","panama.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":417,"content":418,"icon":422},"Parcel cover",[419],{"type":89,"text":420,"spans":421,"direction":92},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":423,"alt":424,"copyright":46,"url":425,"id":426,"edit":427},{"width":411,"height":411},"Money icon","panama.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":429,"content":430,"icon":434},"Customs made easier",[431],{"type":89,"text":432,"spans":433,"direction":92},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":435,"alt":436,"copyright":46,"url":437,"id":438,"edit":439},{"width":411,"height":411},"Passport icon","panama.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":441,"content":442,"icon":446},"Flexible printing options",[443],{"type":89,"text":444,"spans":445,"direction":92},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":447,"alt":448,"copyright":46,"url":449,"id":450,"edit":451},{"width":411,"height":411},"Printer icon","panama.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":452},"#fff",{"title":454,"content":455,"icon":459},"Bulk send",[456],{"type":89,"text":457,"spans":458,"direction":92},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":460,"alt":461,"copyright":46,"url":462,"id":463,"edit":464},{"width":411,"height":411},"Strapped boxes icon","panama.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsU",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":466,"content":467,"icon":471},"Trusted by top UK brands",[468],{"type":89,"text":469,"spans":470,"direction":92},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":472,"alt":473,"copyright":46,"url":474,"id":475,"edit":476},{"width":411,"height":411},"Success icon","panama.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":478,"title":479,"description":46},"standard","Why send internationally with Evri?","list_block$5561303f-d955-4b8d-a3c8-2302fd07d450","list_block",{"variation":177,"version":31,"items":483,"primary":485,"id":498,"slice_type":120,"slice_label":46},[484],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":486,"CardText":487,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":497,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Panama",[488],{"type":89,"text":489,"spans":490,"direction":92},"Our channels are open to a great variety of items; however, there are a few things that you can’t send internationally with Evri. Check out a comprehensive list of what you can and can’t send to make sure your items are safe for transit. ",[491,496],{"start":492,"end":493,"type":99,"data":494},164,191,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":495},"_self",{"start":492,"end":493,"type":111},{"link_type":161},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":177,"version":31,"items":500,"primary":502,"id":547,"slice_type":120,"slice_label":46},[501],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":503,"CardText":504,"ButtonText":156,"ButtonUrl":545,"IsEco":20},"How to format an address when sending to Panama",[505,508,511,514,517,520,523,527,532,537,542],{"type":89,"text":506,"spans":507,"direction":92},"When you send a parcel to Panama, you’ll need to follow the correct address structure: ",[],{"type":187,"text":509,"spans":510,"direction":92},"The recipient’s name ",[],{"type":187,"text":512,"spans":513,"direction":92},"The street address or PO Box number ",[],{"type":187,"text":515,"spans":516,"direction":92},"The district and city\u002Ftown ",[],{"type":187,"text":518,"spans":519,"direction":92},"PANAMA in capital letters on the last line of the address ",[],{"type":89,"text":521,"spans":522,"direction":92},"For example: ",[],{"type":89,"text":524,"spans":525,"direction":92},"Mr  J. Bloggs ",[526],{"start":66,"end":254,"type":111},{"type":89,"text":528,"spans":529,"direction":92},"Calle 74 Este, Casa 123 ",[530],{"start":66,"end":531,"type":111},23,{"type":89,"text":533,"spans":534,"direction":92},"San Francisco, Panama City ",[535],{"start":66,"end":536,"type":111},26,{"type":89,"text":538,"spans":539,"direction":92},"PANAMA ",[540],{"start":66,"end":541,"type":111},6,{"type":89,"text":543,"spans":544,"direction":92},"But don’t worry, just enter the correct address information at checkout and we’ll ensure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label. ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":546,"url":159},"e883c23c-2067-4b01-921e-7be469f61f22","card$01a6a053-7981-4f82-bc6b-1ba7078276c6",{"variation":122,"version":31,"items":549,"primary":585,"id":587,"slice_type":588,"slice_label":46},[550,556,569],{"questionTitle":551,"questionBody":552},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Panama?",[553],{"type":89,"text":554,"spans":555,"direction":92},"A parcel to Panama once dropped off at a ParcelShop or Locker should take around 18-21 days to arrive at its destination. ",[],{"questionTitle":557,"questionBody":558},"Can I track my parcels to Panama?",[559],{"type":89,"text":560,"spans":561,"direction":92},"Absolutely. We offer end-to-end tracking on all our parcels for no additional cost. Simply input your tracking number on our international tracking page, and you’ll be able to see your parcel’s progress.  ",[562,567],{"start":563,"end":564,"type":99,"data":565},125,152,{"link_type":36,"url":566,"target":117},"panama.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":563,"end":568,"type":111},153,{"questionTitle":570,"questionBody":571},"Are there any import taxes to pay on a parcel from the UK to Panama?",[572,575,578],{"type":89,"text":573,"spans":574,"direction":92},"When sending parcels to Panama, you may need to pay customs fees and taxes. The average import tax on goods entering Panama is 7% but the amount can vary depending on the destination, purpose, and value of your parcel. ",[],{"type":89,"text":576,"spans":577,"direction":92},"If your recipient needs to pay customs duty, remember to let them know. We’ll contact your recipient and share a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items. ",[],{"type":89,"text":579,"spans":580,"direction":92},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information. ",[581,584],{"start":221,"end":376,"type":99,"data":582},{"link_type":36,"url":583,"target":117},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":221,"end":376,"type":111},{"title":586},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$4c469f65-6730-41ff-8952-2d59d83cd157","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,121,170,176,257,332,349,394,482,499,548],["Reactive",591],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":592,"$sclients":658,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":661},{"abtasty":593,"accessibe":596,"appPromoBanner":599,"autoDivertUpdates":602,"awin":605,"bulkInternational":608,"bulkSendEnabled":611,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":614,"enableBasketCount":617,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":620,"euCustomsDuty":623,"groovyAdvert":626,"newInternationalSendFlow":629,"newinternationalpages":636,"oohPreferenceFlag":640,"opentel":643,"premium":646,"savedCards":649,"smallParcelSize":652,"yourPricesDrawer":655},{"_createdAt":594,"_updatedAt":595,"enabled":163},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":597,"_updatedAt":598,"enabled":163},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":600,"_updatedAt":601,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":603,"_updatedAt":604,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":606,"_updatedAt":607,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":609,"_updatedAt":610,"enabled":163},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":612,"_updatedAt":613,"enabled":163},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-0